==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Kangaskhan|88}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Kangaskhan|71}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion.
*'''Cross-Cut''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Scyther|57}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

